{"4326220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Perihelion", "steam_appid": 4326220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <strong>Perihelion</strong> is a physics-based space combat roguelite where gravity is your greatest weapon. Launch from your carrier, execute high-speed orbital combat missions, and evolve your ship build run by run — solo or with your squad of up to 4 players.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  <strong>Master Orbital Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first glance, space combat looks simple: aim, shoot, survive. But in Perihelion, nothing moves in a straight line for long. Your ship carries momentum, your weapons inherit your velocity, and nearby planets constantly pull at everything in motion. The result is a combat system where positioning, timing, and understanding gravity matter just as much as reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326220/extras/04a124ad1f1de35de2e68077b3b81193.poster.avif?t=1787161033\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326220/extras/04a124ad1f1de35de2e68077b3b81193.webm?t=1787161033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326220/extras/04a124ad1f1de35de2e68077b3b81193.mp4?t=1787161033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll find yourself slingshotting around planets to gain speed, curving shots through orbit to hit distant targets, and using what feels like a loss of control to turn the fight back in your favor. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rookie pilots may struggle, but once you embrace gravity as an ally, the same forces that once worked against you become the tools you rely on to survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326220/extras/f70029ee52b3408b85eb302bea29bba6.poster.avif?t=1787161033\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326220/extras/f70029ee52b3408b85eb302bea29bba6.webm?t=1787161033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326220/extras/f70029ee52b3408b85eb302bea29bba6.mp4?t=1787161033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  Fly Together</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Team up with up to 4 pilots in full co-op. Coordinate slingshot runs, share radar intel, and fight through branching sorties that scale with your squad. Every wingmate counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326220/extras/5156f92502fee1ad1fcc17c88ddb711b.poster.avif?t=1787161033\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326220/extras/5156f92502fee1ad1fcc17c88ddb711b.webm?t=1787161033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326220/extras/5156f92502fee1ad1fcc17c88ddb711b.mp4?t=1787161033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  <strong>Build Your Perfect Ship</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During a run, each completed sortie presents you with a choice of upgrades that can dramatically change how your ship performs. You might increase your weapon fire rate, alter projectile behavior, add status effects like burn or EMP, or trigger powerful effects on enemy kills. These upgrades stack and interact, allowing you to build distinct builds as the run evolves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between missions, you return to your carrier to invest in a persistent skill tree that improves your survivability, firepower, and tactical flexibility. Whether you’re strengthening your hull, expanding your offensive capabilities, or improving your resource economy, every upgrade carries forward and makes future runs more viable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even failed runs contribute to your progression, ensuring that each attempt means more upgrades at your disposal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326220/extras/1a3d09c4dcba99ad1a05a2bcbafed1e3.poster.avif?t=1787161033\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326220/extras/1a3d09c4dcba99ad1a05a2bcbafed1e3.webm?t=1787161033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326220/extras/1a3d09c4dcba99ad1a05a2bcbafed1e3.mp4?t=1787161033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  Build Bonds With Your Crew</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Between missions, talk with your crew — your commanding officer, flight lead, and more. Build relationships, earn their trust, and unlock story threads that change how the mystery unfolds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  Uncover the Truth</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Your carrier wing once had a sister ship. It vanished. Piece together the real story across runs — through corrupted black boxes, recovered transmissions, and encounters with something no one was prepared for.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <strong>Perihelion</strong> is a physics-based space combat roguelite where gravity is your greatest weapon. Launch from your carrier, execute high-speed orbital combat missions, and evolve your ship build run by run — solo or with your squad of up to 4 players.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  <strong>Master Orbital Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first glance, space combat looks simple: aim, shoot, survive. But in Perihelion, nothing moves in a straight line for long. Your ship carries momentum, your weapons inherit your velocity, and nearby planets constantly pull at everything in motion. The result is a combat system where positioning, timing, and understanding gravity matter just as much as reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326220/extras/04a124ad1f1de35de2e68077b3b81193.poster.avif?t=1787161033\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326220/extras/04a124ad1f1de35de2e68077b3b81193.webm?t=1787161033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326220/extras/04a124ad1f1de35de2e68077b3b81193.mp4?t=1787161033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll find yourself slingshotting around planets to gain speed, curving shots through orbit to hit distant targets, and using what feels like a loss of control to turn the fight back in your favor. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rookie pilots may struggle, but once you embrace gravity as an ally, the same forces that once worked against you become the tools you rely on to survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326220/extras/f70029ee52b3408b85eb302bea29bba6.poster.avif?t=1787161033\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326220/extras/f70029ee52b3408b85eb302bea29bba6.webm?t=1787161033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326220/extras/f70029ee52b3408b85eb302bea29bba6.mp4?t=1787161033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  Fly Together</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Team up with up to 4 pilots in full co-op. Coordinate slingshot runs, share radar intel, and fight through branching sorties that scale with your squad. Every wingmate counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326220/extras/5156f92502fee1ad1fcc17c88ddb711b.poster.avif?t=1787161033\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326220/extras/5156f92502fee1ad1fcc17c88ddb711b.webm?t=1787161033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326220/extras/5156f92502fee1ad1fcc17c88ddb711b.mp4?t=1787161033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  <strong>Build Your Perfect Ship</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During a run, each completed sortie presents you with a choice of upgrades that can dramatically change how your ship performs. You might increase your weapon fire rate, alter projectile behavior, add status effects like burn or EMP, or trigger powerful effects on enemy kills. These upgrades stack and interact, allowing you to build distinct builds as the run evolves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between missions, you return to your carrier to invest in a persistent skill tree that improves your survivability, firepower, and tactical flexibility. Whether you’re strengthening your hull, expanding your offensive capabilities, or improving your resource economy, every upgrade carries forward and makes future runs more viable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even failed runs contribute to your progression, ensuring that each attempt means more upgrades at your disposal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326220/extras/1a3d09c4dcba99ad1a05a2bcbafed1e3.poster.avif?t=1787161033\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326220/extras/1a3d09c4dcba99ad1a05a2bcbafed1e3.webm?t=1787161033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326220/extras/1a3d09c4dcba99ad1a05a2bcbafed1e3.mp4?t=1787161033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  Build Bonds With Your Crew</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Between missions, talk with your crew — your commanding officer, flight lead, and more. Build relationships, earn their trust, and unlock story threads that change how the mystery unfolds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  Uncover the Truth</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Your carrier wing once had a sister ship. It vanished. Piece together the real story across runs — through corrupted black boxes, recovered transmissions, and encounters with something no one was prepared for.</p>", "short_description": "Master orbital combat and bend gravity to your advantage in this space combat roguelite. Launch from your carrier, tackle tactical missions, build crew relationships, and upgrade your ship between runs as you slowly unravel the mystery of a lost sister ship.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai